  "releaseNotes": "Prioritizes Unity 6 while retaining the Unity 2022.3 LTS compatibility bracket. Adds version-specific physics API compatibility and a complete single-player conversion guide covering scene/session setup, networked prefabs, ownership, custom input, local cameras and validation. The offline setup guide is included in this package. Existing consumers use SocketJack.Multiplayer and SocketJack.Multiplayer.Components namespaces; product and assembly identity remain SocketJack.Unity.",
